{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Wipe is a puzzle game where you clear a grid by adding or subtracting numbers. Each move affects a selected cell and its orthogonal neighbors, requiring careful planning to complete the puzzle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate Numbers:</strong> Select a cell to add or subtract from it and its orthogonal neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constraints:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot add to a cell or neighbor if any of them is already at the maximum value (5).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot subtract from a cell or neighbor if any of them is already at 0.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> Clear all numbers from the grid, leaving every cell blank.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic, grid-based design that focuses on strategy and logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are short and self-contained, making them easy to pick up at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logical challenges that require thinking several steps ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 grid sizes (5x5, 7x7, 9x9)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose game difficulty; easy, medium or hard</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065270?t=1760598861","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4065270?t=1760598861","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065270/7f578b400cfbb6930c39b148029b99cadb137c65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760598861","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065270/7f578b400cfbb6930c39b148029b99cadb137c65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760598861","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grid Wipe is a puzzle game where you clear a grid by adding or subtracting numbers. Each move affects a selected cell and its orthogonal neighbors, requiring careful planning to complete the puzzle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate Numbers:</strong> Select a cell to add or subtract from it and its orthogonal neighbors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Constraints:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot add to a cell or neighbor if any of them is already at the maximum value (5).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You cannot subtract from a cell or neighbor if any of them is already at 0.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goal:</strong> Clear all numbers from the grid, leaving every cell blank.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalistic, grid-based design that focuses on strategy and logic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are short and self-contained, making them easy to pick up at any time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logical challenges that require thinking several steps ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 3 grid sizes (5x5, 7x7, 9x9)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose game difficulty; easy, medium or hard</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wuzord"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4065270/90c9197b75d26ef89e2fef0276c6c329cfae8495/header.jpg?t=17605